      <activity id="09710fb5-f250-58be-aa00-4aa159cf8795" activityNameId="5448249d-72eb-5a91-a462-09fa38e5a2dd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Air separation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Air separation plant
Large uncertainties for equipment used due to weak data from small air separation plants. Process refers to an estimated air separation plant with 80'000 t liquid products per year. Assumed life time 20 years.;
UUID: 2fadcdd2-e35e-31e6-bd9e-a8d00a84d031
Aluminium for distillation column, approximated infrastructure process for further infrastructure and dismatling, land use, no energy for construction processes included.
Location: Data partly from U.S. plant producer.
Technology: No specific technology modelled
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Estimation from weak data of smaller plants. 
Extrapolations: Extrapolation small plants with a production volume of 0.1-3 t per hour to a larger plant with 10 t per hour production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2fadcdd2-e35e-31e6-bd9e-a8d00a84d031.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
